  "details": "If you are testing an SDK avatar and update your online status, you automatically switch back to whatever proper avatar you were using beforehand. But if you then try to switch back to the SDK avatar you were testing, the 'Change Into Avatar' button will be greyed out, and it will tell you that you are already using that avatar.\n\nYou have to switch to a different avatar and back to the SDK avatar to continue testing.",
